    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "TypeMates, German type foundry founded 2015 (GbR partnership) by Jakob Runge, Nils Thomsen-Habermann and Lisa Fischbach; distributed offices in Ortenburg, Kiel, Wuppertal/Hamburg and Berlin. Retail and custom typefaces; known faces include Halvar, Cera Pro, Netto, Gregory, Franziska. 60+ retail fonts spanning grotesque, serif, stencil, mono and display. In-use clients include SFMOMA, Zeit Online, Stadt Bielefeld, Pavillon Bosio. Established boutique foundry, approx 10 years. Instagram context shot queued (headless rate-limit): drain with ig.py @typemates.",
